@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15

actor "Desenvolvedor React" as Dev
participant "Interface React\n(TypeScript)" as Web
participant "Core API\n(Go)" as Core
participant "ProviderFactory" as Factory
participant "IConferenceProvider\n(Strategy)" as Strategy
database "MongoDB" as DB

Dev -> Web: Define API e Parâmetros
activate Web
Web -> Core: POST /test/start
activate Core

Core -> Factory: criarProvider(api_tipo)
activate Factory
Factory -> Strategy: instanciar(tipo)
activate Strategy
Strategy --> Factory: Objeto Driver
deactivate Strategy
Factory --> Core: Instância Pronta
deactivate Factory

Core -> DB: Inserir documento de teste (status: configurado)
activate DB
DB --> Core: ID da sessão gerado
deactivate DB

Core --> Web: 200 OK (ID da sessão)
deactivate Core
Web --> Dev: Notifica Sucesso
deactivate Web
@enduml
